 "text": "9/29/26, 9:48 AM\n\nFind Payment Behaviour Summary By Debtor Party\n\nDefinition\n\nTo find payment behavior information of a debtor.\n\nTechnical Data\n\nEntity Type                                         Service Operation\n\nRelease State                                      released\n\nTechnical Name                                 CreditManagementAccountERPPaymentBehaviourSummaryByDebtorPartyQueryResponse_In\nNamespace                                        http://sap.com/xi/FICA/Global2 rt.\nApplication Component                         FI-CA\n\nWeb Service Definition (Back End)           FKK_CMAPaymBehSummBDPQR\nCategory                                            SAP A2A\n\nDirection                                                inbound\n\nMode                                                    synchronous\n\nIdempotency                                          no\n\nChange/Update Behavior                         not applicable\n\nP2P Communication Enabled                  true\n\nBusiness Context and Use\n\nThis service operation queries information about the payment behavior of business partners from the system in which Contract\nAccounts Receivable and Payable (FI-CA) is running and sends the response to the Credit Management system.\n\nFeatures\n\nThe response of the Find Payment Behaviour Summary By Debtor Party service operation transfers information about business\npartners\u2019 payment behavior to the Credit Management process component.\n\nThe following data is transferred:\n\ne DebtorPartylInternallD\ne CreditSegmentinternallD\n\ne CumulatedReceivablesAmount\n",
